  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91ecd6f42660631e58c57b7a71bc4c03, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Parasite.Runtime::Parasite.Missions.EavesdropZone
  flag: eavesdropped
  requiredFlag: 
  radius: 4.5
  seconds: 9
  lines:
  - "\u2026no, Vale's pulling another all-nighter. Says Specimen 7 is 'progressing'."
  - The campus? North block, past Campus Road. Badge at the main gate, like always.
  - "If you forgot your card, use the staff terminal on the west side \u2014 I left
    mine on this table again, ugh."
  - Maintenance keeps the service tunnel shut since the substation tripped. Anyway,
    his office needs two of us to open. Paranoid.
  speaker: DR. PETROV (on the phone)
